WEBVTT

00:03:59.363 --> 00:04:01.486
Have your instincts proven themselves

00:04:01.486 --> 00:04:03.537
to be worthy of your trust?

00:04:03.537 --> 00:04:06.404
Just as we judge other people's testimony

00:04:06.404 --> 00:04:07.991
by their track record,

00:04:07.991 --> 00:04:10.325
so, too, we can judge our own instincts

00:04:10.325 --> 00:04:12.019
by their track record.

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:14.332
And this brings us one step closer

00:04:14.332 --> 00:04:16.534
to an objective view of ourselves

00:04:16.534 --> 00:04:19.604
and our relation to the world around us.